{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_5_level_main_05-03_beg","groupId":"main_5","stageId":"main_05-03","title":"义胆凡躯","storyCode":"5-3","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_05-03_beg.txt","sourceHash":"a2ce7662d5c43057f657645e26a25fe2d3610a47b22578ad5b049a874cf6ea79","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"为了营救线人阿发，陈和星熊开始了行动。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第三关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_uptown_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"11:11 A.M. 天气/小雨\n龙门中城区，三窗仔，木禾仓库外，"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"大致侦察完毕。我们的观察点够隐蔽，仓库四周空无一人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"大量堆砌的建材，荒废的建筑工地，拖动和摆放的痕迹很明显。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"可以肯定整合运动已经布置了埋伏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"老陈，你的线人是阿发。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......是。所以你还是听到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我已经尽力不去听了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我认识他很久很久，到今天为止至少十年。我不可能听不出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"你是什么时候把他发展成线人的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"他一年多前就感染了，从他营生的酒吧里忽然消失，留下他每天擦得干干净净的酒杯在那落灰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"可能更早。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"至少这个，你应该告诉我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"可能要下雨了。立刻开始排查，把敌人从埋伏点轰出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"——唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"来不及。他没剩下多少血可流。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我去吸引火力，把所有整合运动都引出来。你们包围他们，结束这场战斗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"很危险。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"这样做是最快的。这一次，你可以信任我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我一直都信任你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"按星熊督察说的部署。动作快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近卫局成员","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"星熊，我准备好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"这才像话！我会把所有埋伏点都毁掉，把他们全都逼出来。给我三分钟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"乱来，你要独自作战三分钟，毁掉所有埋伏点？别被冲昏头脑！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你出了任何差错，我会立刻指挥进攻！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"不。给我三分钟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......只有三分钟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我去了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["陈"]},{"speakerId":"char_015_lmg","aliases":["近卫局成员"]},{"speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","aliases":["星熊"]}]}
